OL,3,GNEWSA'No easy solution' to Everton rail
OL,4,Astation congestion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is "no easy solution" to crowd
OL,7,Fcongestion problems at a rail station
OL,8,Fserving thousands of football fans at
OL,9,FEverton's new Hill Dickinson Stadium,
OL,10,Fthe mayor of the Liverpool city region
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FSteve Rotheram met the club's fan
OL,14,Fadvisory board after they wrote to him
OL,15,Fraising concerns at Sandhills station
OL,16,Fincluding excessive queues, issues with
OL,17,Faccessibility and a lack of shelter and
OL,18,Ftoilets.
OL,20,FBoard secretary Rob Galkoff said the
OL,21,Fconversation on Friday had been
OL,22,F"productive".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
