OL,3,GNEWSA'No easy solution' to Everton rail
OL,4,Astation congestion
OL,5,
OL,6,FRotheram told BBC Radio Merseyside that
OL,7,Fthe situation had been "well known"
OL,8,Fwhen the club relocated from Goodison
OL,9,FPark but he would do "everything he
OL,10,Fcould" to improve things.
